WEBVTT

00:12.220 --> 00:14.639
Are you okay, Inumaki?

00:14.723 --> 00:15.724
Salmon.

00:16.599 --> 00:17.559
It's coming!

00:18.518 --> 00:19.394
Stop!

00:21.771 --> 00:23.732
Convergence, Piercing Blood!

00:26.818 --> 00:28.570
He hurt it with his technique.

00:29.070 --> 00:31.865
So he wasn't serious when he fought me?

00:33.366 --> 00:35.452
Hurry up! It will heal itself soon!

00:38.038 --> 00:42.041
Let Inumaki stop it,
then we'll attack and gain distance.

00:42.542 --> 00:45.170
We'll rinse and repeat
to escape out of the Veil,

00:45.253 --> 00:47.046
and meet with the principal and others.

00:48.339 --> 00:51.926
But we don't know
if we can keep doing this.

00:54.179 --> 00:56.848
The Cursed Speech
is becoming less effective.

00:56.931 --> 00:59.225
And there's no time
to contact any teacher.

01:00.351 --> 01:02.896
If that thing finds a way
to deal with Cursed Speech,

01:02.979 --> 01:04.439
then it's over.

01:07.192 --> 01:08.401
Hurry up!

01:11.112 --> 01:13.031
We don't know its motive, too.

01:13.531 --> 01:18.369
The principal and other Jujutsu Sorcerers
may not be coming just yet.

01:20.038 --> 01:21.456
We have to find Todo.

01:21.539 --> 01:25.043
Or at the very least,
we should meet up with Miwa.

01:36.554 --> 01:39.641
Inumaki will stop it,
so don't worry and go!

01:40.683 --> 01:41.893
Stop--

01:50.068 --> 01:52.403
Have we reached our limit first?

02:01.371 --> 02:03.873
Are you alive, Kamo?

02:07.877 --> 02:11.631
Inumaki's throat already gave out
even without using powerful words.

02:12.340 --> 02:13.800
This shows that…

02:14.425 --> 02:16.010
the enemy's far superior.

02:23.643 --> 02:24.727
Leaf mustard.

02:27.188 --> 02:30.650
Inumaki, you can't…

02:41.286 --> 02:42.579
Blast Away!

03:01.180 --> 03:04.058
This blunt sword cannot hurt me at all.

03:17.447 --> 03:19.908
The tree branch in its eye socket
is more fragile.

03:20.950 --> 03:23.828
This katana is not too bad.

03:28.166 --> 03:30.043
I have something even better.

03:31.252 --> 03:35.298
Although using it makes me feel disgusted.

03:38.593 --> 03:42.597
Cursed Tools are weapons
infused with cursed energy.

03:43.890 --> 03:47.560
The power and potency
of these Cursed Tools

03:47.644 --> 03:50.647
are categorized into four grades,
just like Jujutsu Sorcerers.

03:51.397 --> 03:53.358
The higher the grade,

03:53.441 --> 03:57.195
the greater the advantage granted
to the user in a sorcery battle.

03:58.321 --> 04:01.282
You must not lose this, Megumi.

04:01.366 --> 04:02.700
I won't lose it.

04:03.243 --> 04:05.787
It's worth at least 500 million yen.

04:05.870 --> 04:06.704
What?

04:07.288 --> 04:10.083
Special-Grade Cursed Tool, Playful Cloud!

04:25.098 --> 04:27.809
That attack wasn't too bad.

04:29.769 --> 04:31.312
Divine Dog…

04:32.230 --> 04:34.482
With the exception
of The Well's Unknown Abyss,

04:34.565 --> 04:36.609
if the shikigami
from my Ten Shadows Technique

04:36.693 --> 04:39.153
is completely destroyed,

04:39.237 --> 04:41.948
they will never manifest again.

04:45.868 --> 04:50.915
But the cursed technique and power
left by the destroyed shikigami…

04:54.002 --> 04:56.546
will be inherited by other shikigami.

05:00.133 --> 05:01.551
…Totality!

05:07.640 --> 05:08.808
It's fast.

05:08.891 --> 05:11.311
Are they planning
to finish my injured arm first?

05:13.563 --> 05:16.524
The young Jujutsu Sorcerer
is in the forest.

05:20.903 --> 05:22.655
It's that boy's sword.

05:25.783 --> 05:26.951
Maki!

05:35.877 --> 05:38.838
Don't ever make me use
that three-sectioned staff again.

05:39.338 --> 05:40.339
It's too hard to use.

05:40.840 --> 05:42.633
It's useful when you're used--

05:42.717 --> 05:43.551
Megumi!

05:48.598 --> 05:49.599
Maki!

05:49.682 --> 05:52.185
Darn it! I was too careless!

05:54.854 --> 05:57.607
I aimed it at your heart.

05:57.690 --> 05:59.734
Your reflexes are outstanding.

06:00.818 --> 06:03.321
Jujutsu Sorcerers are truly emotional.

06:03.404 --> 06:09.619
They are full of openings
when their allies are hurt.

06:12.705 --> 06:15.249
Is it destroyed? It can't be.

06:15.333 --> 06:17.710
Megumi's cursed technique
has been dispelled.

06:18.711 --> 06:21.714
You better stop using cursed techniques.

06:22.715 --> 06:26.302
The sprouts in your body
love cursed energy the most.

06:26.385 --> 06:31.599
The more cursed technique you use,
the bigger it grows inside your body.

06:32.183 --> 06:33.810
Thank you for your explanation.

06:33.893 --> 06:36.104
You plan to kill me anyway.

06:36.687 --> 06:40.358
I heard that it's more effective
after the explanation.

06:42.026 --> 06:44.153
You move well.

06:49.909 --> 06:53.412
But your movements
aren't as sharp as before.

07:00.503 --> 07:05.424
I have to squeeze out cursed energy,
even if my stomach explodes.

07:07.343 --> 07:09.679
Unlike everyone else,

07:10.471 --> 07:12.849
I choose who I will protect.

07:14.392 --> 07:17.186
I have the least to lose.

07:17.895 --> 07:19.147
So…

07:20.356 --> 07:26.446
I'm not allowed to fall
before anyone else does!

07:29.615 --> 07:31.576
Don't do it, Megumi!

07:36.247 --> 07:38.499
Our work ends here.

07:39.041 --> 07:40.918
It's time to tag out.

07:49.719 --> 07:50.970
What?

07:56.726 --> 07:59.520
Can you do it, my friend?

08:02.732 --> 08:03.733
Yes!

09:40.329 --> 09:41.998
You're so heavy.

09:42.790 --> 09:45.960
I didn't expect these two
to end up in this condition.

09:46.919 --> 09:49.297
I'm counting on you, Todo.

09:50.631 --> 09:54.010
You're nothing else but powerful.

09:58.180 --> 10:00.224
Don't, Itadori.

10:00.766 --> 10:03.227
That's not something we…

10:06.230 --> 10:07.064
Panda.

10:07.148 --> 10:08.566
Yes.

10:10.192 --> 10:12.653
Take them, and leave the Veil.

10:12.737 --> 10:17.199
Nishimiya said that this Veil
is aimed at Satoru Gojo.

10:17.283 --> 10:20.202
We can go in and out anytime.

10:20.286 --> 10:23.497
-Wait. Even if it's you--
-Fushiguro!

10:23.581 --> 10:24.582
What?

10:27.460 --> 10:28.836
It will be okay.

10:28.919 --> 10:30.087
Please.

10:32.673 --> 10:34.884
It seems that you noticed.

10:34.967 --> 10:39.764
Someone growing out of his shell
cannot be touched by anyone else.

10:39.847 --> 10:43.100
That's what is happening to Itadori now.

10:44.352 --> 10:46.312
If you die again, I will kill you.

10:46.937 --> 10:48.898
Come on. Let's go.

10:49.690 --> 10:51.692
Panda sprint!

10:52.276 --> 10:55.112
Guess that means I can't die.

10:56.197 --> 10:58.199
I won't intervene,

10:59.200 --> 11:00.284
Itadori.

11:00.910 --> 11:04.080
Not until you manage to use Black Flash.

11:04.580 --> 11:06.707
If you're unable to use Black Flash,

11:06.791 --> 11:11.754
then I'll be prepared to watch you die.

11:12.380 --> 11:13.255
Got it!

11:14.006 --> 11:16.217
That's Sukuna's vessel…

11:16.300 --> 11:18.177
and who's that man?

11:18.886 --> 11:23.265
He's bold, but based on
his amount of cursed energy,

11:23.349 --> 11:26.352
he's definitely weaker than me.

11:26.852 --> 11:29.355
But he has enigmatic strength.

11:29.438 --> 11:32.400
Does he have a powerful cursed technique?

11:32.483 --> 11:35.778
I shouldn't be reckless for now.

11:36.362 --> 11:38.364
Besides, what is this "Black Flash"?

11:39.490 --> 11:41.534
Now then, what will they do?

11:44.036 --> 11:47.248
Can you talk?

11:48.249 --> 11:50.376
I have a question for you.

11:52.336 --> 11:54.088
Among your comrades,

11:54.588 --> 11:58.217
is there a patch-faced Cursed Spirit?

11:59.593 --> 12:02.221
What if I say yes?

12:05.975 --> 12:07.893
You're vigilant when closing the distance.

12:07.977 --> 12:09.812
This is commendable.

12:11.897 --> 12:13.065
He's fast.

12:13.149 --> 12:16.026
He has more momentum
than that girl just now.

12:16.777 --> 12:19.822
However, he has weak power.

12:20.489 --> 12:22.283
Its torso is defenseless.

12:22.867 --> 12:25.369
It underestimated me
because of my weak attack!

12:25.453 --> 12:26.787
This will work!

12:26.871 --> 12:28.706
Black Flash!

12:29.999 --> 12:31.000
It's coming.

12:33.127 --> 12:34.545
Darn it!

12:40.593 --> 12:42.303
My friend.

12:45.723 --> 12:49.727
Anger is an important trigger
for Jujutsu Sorcerers.

12:50.227 --> 12:55.900
Sometimes, angering your opponent
can make them perform worse.

12:56.692 --> 12:58.360
The same goes vice versa.

12:58.903 --> 13:00.779
Anger can mess up your cursed energy,

13:00.863 --> 13:04.033
making you lose
without showing your true strength.

13:04.116 --> 13:05.409
Got that?

13:05.493 --> 13:07.578
Your friend was injured,

13:07.661 --> 13:12.541
and more importantly, they interrupted
your honeymoon with me, your best friend.

13:12.625 --> 13:17.421
I can understand
how angry you are right now.

13:18.214 --> 13:21.425
But this anger is too much for you.

13:22.343 --> 13:23.928
Suppress it now.

13:27.097 --> 13:29.892
Are they fighting among themselves?

13:31.018 --> 13:33.479
Did the distractions get drowned out?

13:35.439 --> 13:36.440
Yes.

13:36.524 --> 13:38.067
They vanished without a trace.

13:39.068 --> 13:42.238
Thank you so much, best friend!

13:44.281 --> 13:45.533
Black Flash.

13:46.033 --> 13:50.371
It is a distortion in space
that occurs when cursed energy

13:50.454 --> 13:55.125
is applied with 0.000001 seconds
of a physical hit.

13:55.793 --> 13:59.630
On average, the force of strike
is raised 2.5 times.

14:00.214 --> 14:04.426
No Jujutsu Sorcerer is capable
of using it at will.

14:04.927 --> 14:06.637
However,

14:07.304 --> 14:11.642
for those who have experienced
and not experienced Black Flash,

14:11.725 --> 14:16.647
there's a huge difference between
the distance to their cursed energy cores.

14:22.987 --> 14:24.989
What immense concentration.

14:25.489 --> 14:28.951
At the moment when the cursed energy

14:29.034 --> 14:32.162
collides with the strike
within less than 0.000001 seconds…

14:34.248 --> 14:35.583
Space will be distorted.

14:36.250 --> 14:38.544
The cursed energy flashes black!

14:39.712 --> 14:40.796
Black Flash!

14:44.925 --> 14:45.843
What?

14:52.016 --> 14:53.309
You did it.

15:06.906 --> 15:08.532
He did it.

15:12.870 --> 15:16.040
That was Black Flash?

15:17.583 --> 15:18.751
What's this?

15:19.251 --> 15:22.463
This cursed energy is mine, right?

15:23.047 --> 15:25.549
You just understood
the taste of cursed energy.

15:30.304 --> 15:32.014
Until now,

15:32.097 --> 15:35.017
you were just throwing
unfamiliar ingredients

15:35.100 --> 15:39.605
into the pot and stewing them
based on your feelings.

15:40.606 --> 15:43.067
But with Black Flash,

15:43.150 --> 15:47.029
you now understand the taste
of the ingredient known as cursed energy.

15:47.613 --> 15:48.697
As a chef,

15:48.781 --> 15:52.534
you're now a different person
from who you were three seconds ago.

15:56.747 --> 15:59.124
You can become stronger.

16:00.125 --> 16:05.297
I heard that Sukuna's vessel
was just a subpar sorcerer.

16:05.923 --> 16:08.801
On top of that, that mysterious man…

16:08.884 --> 16:12.054
They are somewhat different
from the others.

16:12.638 --> 16:14.056
It can heal itself?

16:14.556 --> 16:17.601
A Cursed Spirit's body
is made with cursed energy.

16:18.102 --> 16:23.440
Unlike us, they don't need advanced
reversal cursed technique to heal.

16:23.524 --> 16:27.569
For a Special-Grade,
this kind of injury is nothing.

16:28.153 --> 16:31.281
But it can undoubtedly
use up its cursed energy.

16:31.365 --> 16:34.326
It's game over once you crush its head.

16:35.160 --> 16:38.330
Come, let's start cooking!

16:39.915 --> 16:44.461
It appears that…

16:45.462 --> 16:49.425
I have to be more serious
when dealing with the both of you.

17:08.235 --> 17:10.320
What a wide attack range.

17:10.404 --> 17:13.615
Don't be scared!
It's sacrificing its power and speed.

17:21.957 --> 17:22.875
It's so heavy.

17:23.375 --> 17:26.628
It's not as powerful
as that Black Flash just now,

17:27.212 --> 17:32.634
but their respective powers
can indeed hurt me.

17:32.718 --> 17:35.763
Todo, let's match our timing better!

17:35.846 --> 17:36.889
Got it!

17:37.431 --> 17:38.807
What?

17:39.516 --> 17:40.934
Our footing…

17:41.018 --> 17:42.227
We're too careless.

17:42.311 --> 17:43.645
That thing was so huge,

17:43.729 --> 17:47.191
I thought it was controlling real plants
with its cursed energy.

17:47.775 --> 17:51.278
Turns out that everything was
just manifested using cursed energy!

17:51.361 --> 17:53.197
As expected from a Special-Grade!

17:53.906 --> 17:56.658
Appreciate how precious the earth is.

17:57.326 --> 17:59.912
Attacking us while we're falling?
That's sick!

17:59.995 --> 18:00.829
However…

18:05.876 --> 18:07.461
They dodged that?

18:07.961 --> 18:09.755
But what's going on?

18:09.838 --> 18:12.758
What is this feeling?

18:19.389 --> 18:23.227
You should be more honest, Hanami.

18:23.852 --> 18:27.189
I'm not hiding anything.

18:27.856 --> 18:30.484
I don't mean that you're a liar.

18:31.068 --> 18:33.529
I know why you fight.

18:33.612 --> 18:37.866
But I think you should learn
to enjoy the process more,

18:37.950 --> 18:40.744
which is fighting.

18:41.537 --> 18:43.705
Do you enjoy fighting, Mahito?

18:44.248 --> 18:45.332
Kind of.

18:45.415 --> 18:46.750
However…

18:47.626 --> 18:50.170
The joy and happiness
that I feel in a fight

18:50.254 --> 18:53.507
only became my motivation recently.

18:53.590 --> 18:55.300
Once I realized,

18:55.384 --> 18:58.053
deception, cheating, and killing…

18:58.137 --> 19:00.764
They started to give me satisfaction.

19:01.348 --> 19:04.143
Like how human beings eat,
sleep, and commit violence,

19:04.226 --> 19:07.020
I guess this is the nature of us curses.

19:07.688 --> 19:11.316
We may have gained rationality.

19:11.817 --> 19:16.405
But this is no reason for us
to go against our instinct.

19:18.115 --> 19:21.535
The soul is a mixture
of instinct and rationality.

19:23.245 --> 19:27.291
Others should not criticize
your mixing ratio.

19:27.875 --> 19:31.628
However, I believe your soul
feels a little restrained.

19:33.172 --> 19:34.423
Hanami…

19:35.174 --> 19:39.344
You're actually stronger, right?

19:41.471 --> 19:43.265
It hurts…

19:44.141 --> 19:45.559
Todo!

19:46.143 --> 19:47.603
I'm okay.

20:03.493 --> 20:05.204
It used up a lot of cursed energy.

20:06.038 --> 20:08.582
This is the time to destroy it!

20:08.665 --> 20:10.459
You monster!

20:19.134 --> 20:20.469
Mahito.

20:21.053 --> 20:22.554
I am…

20:23.889 --> 20:25.557
enjoying…

20:26.558 --> 20:28.727
this fight now!

20:30.979 --> 20:33.106
Are you okay, brother?

20:33.732 --> 20:36.151
-No problem!
-Good. In that case…

20:36.944 --> 20:40.447
It's time to unleash my cursed technique.

22:11.663 --> 22:13.415
-Juju Stroll!
-Juju Stroll!

22:13.498 --> 22:15.375
Clothing rack!

22:15.459 --> 22:19.379
I can make an amazing clothing rack.

22:19.463 --> 22:25.218
Hey, how does Satoru Gojo's
clothing rack look like?

22:26.720 --> 22:28.722
It should be a single-pole clothing rack.

22:29.306 --> 22:31.808
The sacrum will be the stand.

22:31.892 --> 22:35.187
Using the hip bone
with the coccyx as a base,

22:35.270 --> 22:38.273
I'll fix it with processed thigh bone.

22:39.524 --> 22:42.944
For the spine,
I'll use the lumbar and thoracic vertebra,

22:43.028 --> 22:45.530
all the way
until the third cervical vertebra.

22:45.614 --> 22:48.450
As for the length, well…

22:48.533 --> 22:50.118
Jindaikusu wood would be good.

22:50.202 --> 22:52.954
I'll use Jindaikusu wood
to create spine replicas

22:53.038 --> 22:55.624
and insert them in between
to increase the height.

22:57.084 --> 22:59.669
I'll observe the overall balance,

23:00.212 --> 23:04.716
and lengthen the spinous
and transverse process to make hooks.

23:07.803 --> 23:11.098
I should also use Jindaikusu wood here
to make it look like I'm grafting.

23:11.890 --> 23:13.433
Depending on the brain color,

23:13.517 --> 23:16.853
I can also use it to wrap around
like suede leather.

23:17.354 --> 23:20.524
Wow! It's going to be so good.

23:20.607 --> 23:24.444
I can make an amazing clothing rack!

23:24.528 --> 23:25.862
I don't want that.
